{"ref":"BDB, צוֹם","hw":"צוֹם","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">צוֹם</span></big>  <strong>n.m.</strong> <sup><a data-ref=\"Isaiah 58:5\" href=\"/Isaiah.58.5\">Is 58:5</a></sup> <strong>fasting, fast</strong>;—<span dir=\"rtl\">צ׳</span> abs. <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 12:16\" href=\"/II_Samuel.12.16\">2 S 12:16</a> +, cstr. <a data-ref=\"Zechariah 8:19\" href=\"/Zechariah.8.19\">Zc 8:19</a> (4 times); sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">צֹמְכֶם</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 58:3\" href=\"/Isaiah.58.3\">Is 58:3</a>; pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">צוֹמוֹת</span> <a data-ref=\"Esther 9:31\" href=\"/Esther.9.31\">Est 9:31</a>;—<em>fast</em>, as acc. cogn. <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 12:16\" href=\"/II_Samuel.12.16\">2 S 12:16</a>; public observance <a data-ref=\"I Kings 21:9\" href=\"/I_Kings.21.9\">1 K 21:9</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Kings 21:12\" href=\"/I_Kings.21.12\">12</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 20:3\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.20.3\">2 Ch 20:3</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezra 8:21\" href=\"/Ezra.8.21\">Ezr 8:21</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 36:9\" href=\"/Jeremiah.36.9\">Je 36:9</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jonah 3:5\" href=\"/Jonah.3.5\">Jon 3:5</a> (all obj. of <span dir=\"rtl\">קָרָא</span> <em>proclaim</em>), cf. <a data-ref=\"Joel 1:14\" href=\"/Joel.1.14\">Jo 1:14</a>; <a data-ref=\"Joel 2:15\" href=\"/Joel.2.15\">2:15</a> (both obj. of <span dir=\"rtl\">קַדְּשׁוּ</span>); <span dir=\"rtl\">יוֹם צוֹם</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 36:6\" href=\"/Jeremiah.36.6\">Je 36:6</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">יוֹם צֹמְכֶם</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 58:3\" href=\"/Isaiah.58.3\">Is 58:3</a>, cf. v <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 58:5\" href=\"/Isaiah.58.5\">5</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">יוֹם עַנּוֹת אָדָם נַפְשׁוֹ</span>), v <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 58:5\" href=\"/Isaiah.58.5\">5</a>, <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 58:6\" href=\"/Isaiah.58.6\">6</a>; of periodic fasts <a data-ref=\"Zechariah 8:19\" href=\"/Zechariah.8.19\">Zc 8:19</a><sup>(×4)</sup> <a data-ref=\"Esther 9:31\" href=\"/Esther.9.31\">Est 9:31</a>; act or state of fasting, <span dir=\"rtl\">נֶאֶסְפוּ בְצ׳ וּבְשַׂקִּים</span> <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 9:1\" href=\"/Nehemiah.9.1\">Ne 9:1</a> cf. <a data-ref=\"Joel 2:12\" href=\"/Joel.2.12\">Jo 2:12</a>; <a data-ref=\"Daniel 9:3\" href=\"/Daniel.9.3\">Dn 9:3</a>; <a data-ref=\"Esther 4:3\" href=\"/Esther.4.3\">Est 4:3</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">עִנֵּיתִי בַצּ׳ נַפְשִׁי</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 35:13\" href=\"/Psalms.35.13\">ψ 35:13</a> cf. <a data-ref=\"Psalms 69:11\" href=\"/Psalms.69.11\">69:11</a> (on <span dir=\"rtl\">וָאֶבְכֶּה</span> v. Che Bae); causing physical weakness <a data-ref=\"Psalms 109:24\" href=\"/Psalms.109.24\">109:24</a>.","next":"BDB, צוע","prev":"BDB, צוּם"}